name modref
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc Customisation of cross-references in LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc The package contains macros which allow authors to easily
longdesc customise how cross-references appear in their document, both
longdesc in general (across all cross-references) and for particular
longdesc types of references (identified by a prefix in the reference
longdesc label), in a very generic manner.
